.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.linkedin.com/in/daniel-remler/\" target=\"_blank\">Daniel Remler</a>, WDC, AI and diplomacy.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/jacobneplokh\" target=\"_blank\">Jacob Neplokh</a>, University of Chicago, political theory and the great books.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.ksred.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Kyle Redlinghuys</a>, London, AI-enhanced pre-natal testing.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.linkedin.com/in/paddy-corcoran-424a19267/?originalSubdomain=ie\" target=\"_blank\">Paddy Corcoran</a> and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.linkedin.com/in/sean-cahill-94a77931b/?originalSubdomain=ie\" target=\"_blank\">Sean Cahill</a>, 16 and 17, Tipperary, app for TikTok and study.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.juandavidcampolargo.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Juan David Campolargo</a>, Illinois, to write a book on universities and how to get the most out of them.</p>\r\n<p>And here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.evwinners.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Nabeel’s semantic search for previous EV winners</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/emergent-ventures-winners-47th-cohort.html\">Emergent Ventures winners, 47th cohort</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/925872257/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/925872257/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=